    <statement><p>Perform the following operations on the vectors <m>\vec{u} = \left\lt -2,1,-5\right&gt;</m>, <m>\vec{v} = \left\lt -1,-1,-2\right&gt;</m>, and <m>\vec{w} = \left\lt 4,-2,2\right&gt;</m>.</p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{w} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>(\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v}) \vec{u} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><m>((\vec{w} \cdot \vec{w}) \vec{u} ) \cdot \vec{u} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} + \vec{v} \cdot \vec{w} =</m> 
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-20</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;-22,11,-55\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>720</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>5</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>SOLUTION</p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{w} = \lt -2,1,-5&gt; \cdot \lt 4,-2,2&gt; = -20</m></p>
<p><m>(\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v}) \vec{u} = 11 \lt -2,1,-5&gt; = \lt -22,11,-55&gt;</m></p>
<p><m>\begin{array}{lcl} ((\vec{w} \cdot \vec{w}) \vec{u} ) \cdot \vec{u}\amp  =\amp  
(24 \lt -2,1,-5&gt;)\cdot \lt -2,1,-5&gt; \\\amp =\amp  \lt -48,24,-120&gt; \cdot \lt -2,1,-5&gt; = 720 \end{array}</m></p>
<p><m>\vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} + \vec{v} \cdot \vec{w} = 11  - 6 = 5</m></p>
</solution>
